    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13653" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσάττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unsaddle, unpack,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισάττω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				24.32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stop up, caulk,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Din.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				89.10
			</span></i>; <i>stuff with food,</i>
